        "text": "Can a tiny push lift a bigger load?",
        "speed": 1.03
      },
      {
        "start": 4.15,
        "end": 7.8,
        "text": "Push here. The liquid transmits pressure.",
        "speed": 1.03
      },
      {
        "start": 8.15,
        "end": 11.8,
        "text": "This piston has four times the area.",
        "speed": 1.03
      },
      {
        "start": 12.15,
        "end": 15.8,
        "text": "Same pressure. Four times the force!",
        "speed": 1.03
      },
      {
        "start": 16.15,
        "end": 20.8,
        "text": "But watch! It moves only one quarter as far.",
        "speed": 1.03
      },
      {
        "start": 21.15,
        "end": 24.8,
        "text": "More force. Less distance. No free energy.",
        "speed": 1.03
      },
      {
        "start": 25.15,
        "end": 27.8,
        "text": "That’s hydraulics. Pretty clever, right?",
        "speed": 1.03
      }
    ],
